abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials for the survey Underwater Image Enhancement:
  Imaging Models, Learning Paradigms, Benchmarks, and Evaluation. The repository
  contains manifests, method provenance, per-image results, statistical analyses,
  and reproduction scripts. Third-party datasets and model weights are excluded.
